# The record adapters are code and are versioned. Everything they FETCH or
# DERIVE is neither.
#
# cache/ is 349 MB of archive.org _djvu.xml and hOCR, re-fetchable by identifier
# (`extract.py <id>`); decisions.jsonl is its extract. Both are reproducible and
# neither is a measurement, so neither is kept.
cache/
decisions.jsonl
__pycache__/
*.bak
